/*
 * Declares the ImplSymbol class.
 *
 * ImplSymbol represents the semantic placeholder associated with an `impl`
 * declaration (`ImplDecl`) inside a class or module. It is inserted into the
 * symbol table so that the compiler can track and validate `impl` blocks, which
 * typically provide additional methods or behavior for a type. 
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::symbol::impl_
